          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You make a ranged Strike with a thrown weapon you already have in your hand, Stride, and then @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Interact] to draw another weapon.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Rage]{Raging}, and end the Stride adjacent to an enemy, that enemy is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] against the next Strike you make against it with the weapon you drew before the end of your next turn.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
