    {
      "fileName": "viking-dedication.json",
      "id": "JuEUNrvsxOYdXeYL",
      "name": "Viking Dedication",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "JuEUNrvsxOYdXeYL",
        "folder": "mRzYxL4bECgRNZMu",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Viking Dedication",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Vikings spend long periods of time at sea, only to leap from their boats at a moment's notice, charge through the surf, and take their enemies by storm. You gain the Additional Lore general feat for Sailing Lore and Warfare Lore.</p>\n<p>When using your land Speed, you ignore difficult terrain from shallow water, such as in bogs or on beaches. In addition, if you roll a success on an Athletics check to Swim, you get a critical success instead.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.vx5FGEG34AxI2dow.JournalEntryPage.2CbiV0VtDKZfQNte]{Viking}</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "trained in Athletics"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype",
              "dedication"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 2,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "viking-weapon-familiarity.json",
      "id": "j9Rp4fOZIxizyvYy",
      "name": "Viking Weapon Familiarity",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "j9Rp4fOZIxizyvYy",
        "folder": "mRzYxL4bECgRNZMu",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Viking Weapon Familiarity",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>From childhood, you have been exposed to traditional viking combat techniques, and you soon learned to handle axe, sword, and shield in battle. Now, you can raid proudly alongside your fellows. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Shield Block] reaction. Additionally, you have familiarity with the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Battle Axe], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Hatchet], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Longsword], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Shield Boss], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Shield Spikes], and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Shortsword]—for the purposes of proficiency, you treat any of these weapons as simple weapons.</p>\n<p>At 5th level, whenever you get a critical hit with one of these weapons, you get its critical specialization effect.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Viking Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "GrantItem",
              "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Shield Block"
            },
            {
              "definition": [
                {
